{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1060,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Research has shown that, if you're repeatedly exposed to the phrase:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5020,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"The body temperature of a chicken.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7200,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. \"The body temperature of a chicken.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9880,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if no useful information is given about the body temperature of a chicken, you are more likely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15620,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to judge as true this statement: \"the body temperature of a chicken is 34 degrees Celsius.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21560,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not, by the way, it's actually closer to 41."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24480,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this finding highlights an important aspect of our psychology that plays a huge role in how we see the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30420,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The things we're exposed to repeatedly feel more true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33680,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the way this seems to work is through a mechanism called cognitive ease."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37500,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cognitive ease is a measure of how hard your brain is working."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40900,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From easy, like when you're scrolling through Facebook,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43340,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To hard, like if you're trying to multiply 14 times 37 in your head."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46720,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things that are true generally elicit cognitive ease."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50200,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like \"fire is hot\", \"earth revolves around the sun\", \"dogs have four legs\", and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55040,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only do these things feel true, they also feel familiar. Effortless."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58980,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they feel good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60360,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of these are outcomes of cognitive ease."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62640,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the trouble arises because cognitive ease can be artificially created in other ways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67500,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One way is just by repeating the stimulus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70220,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a classic experiment at two Michigan universities,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72520,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experimenters took out ads in the school newspapers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75780,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each ad consisted only of one of these nonsense words"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83200,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were printed with different frequencies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84940,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One word appeared on the paper only once"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87000,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while others appeared two, five, ten or twenty-five times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90980,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The word frequencies were reversed at the other unversity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93980,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the end of the experiment, researchers sent out questionnaires"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97240,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "asking people to rate the meaning of each of these nonsense words"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100560,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on a scale from \"it means something good\" to \"it means something bad.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104640,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the findings were clear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106080,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The more frequently the word had appeared in the newspaper,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108980,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the more people thought it meant something good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111160,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, with enough repetition, even a nonsense word comes to feel familiar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116140,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It triggers cognitive ease and overall feelings of goodness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119620,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Experiments have shown that this also works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121540,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when showing English speakers Chinese charachters or even random shapes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125800,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the finding is even more general than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128080,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Songs are judged more favorably after you've listened to them a bunch of times than on the first listening,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133420,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and participants looking at yearbook photos judge the people in the photos as more likable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137720,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after seeing that photo more times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140440,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that brings up the question, what are the Kardashians famous for?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144180,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Depending on who you ask, you may find that they're famous for nothing, or just famous for being famous,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149380,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but really they are famous for exactly the same reason anyone is famous, and that's because you've heard their names"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154820,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and seen their faces over and over again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157380,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, they are familiar, you have experience  with them in the past, and therefore they are processed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161660,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with cognitive ease, which also feels good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164260,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is at the core of the advertising industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166640,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The idea that, repeated often enough,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168620,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even \"brown carbonated sugar water\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170840,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seems really appealing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172400,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, maybe it shouldn't be surprising that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174500,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "repeated stimuli are perceived more favorably."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176980,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After all, our brains have evolved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179020,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to identify threats."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180460,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And anything novel is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182060,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a potential threat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183260,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, if after repeated exposure nothing bad happens,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186180,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it becomes familiar and comfortable and therefore"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188600,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a sign of safety rather than a threat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191380,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this general phenomenon extends beyond humans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194200,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Chicks who were played a tone when they were in the egg,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196920,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "later made fewer distress calls"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198400,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the same tone was played to them as chicks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201880,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But repetition is not the only way to create cognitive ease."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205760,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Images with higher contrast are perceived by the brain with more cognitive ease,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209500,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "making them feel good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211160,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which explains most of the Instagram filters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214260,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In another study, people who were shown images"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216600,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the outline was projected quickly and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218980,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "imperceptibly before the image,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220900,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they started to smile and relax their brows"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223380,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as measured by electrodes on these muscles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225720,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Videos with bad audio quality and low contrast"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228780,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "create cognitive strain as you try to figure out what's going on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232020,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "possibly searching for threats."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233980,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You may not have noticed just now, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235500,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your brows probably furrowed and your mouth started to frown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238480,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which is why we prefer high-contrast video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240440,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with crisp audio."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241720,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the same applies to text,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243560,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so which of these statements do you think is true?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247920,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, actually, it's a trick question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249820,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was born in 1879."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251780,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, studies have shown that people will often choose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254020,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the more legible answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256020,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nice, contrasting bold text"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258320,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is easier and quicker to read, it's handled with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260840,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more cognitive ease, and is therefore\njudged to be more true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264000,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lawyers with easily pronounced last names"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266260,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are over-represented, higher up the chain in law firms,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269640,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even controling for rarity and ethnicity of the names."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273040,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And even companies that have pronounceable abbreviations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275500,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the stock market out-perform those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277500,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with unpronounceable tags,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279300,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which you'll be happy to know if you have stock"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281300,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in those companies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282600,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And being happy, in fact,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284020,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that makes you more likely to experience"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286020,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cognitive ease as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287320,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This, in turn, makes you more intuitive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289680,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Try this: What connects these three things?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292840,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"cottage\", \"Swiss\", \"cake.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295860,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All English speakers recognise a unique solution:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298780,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cheese."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300060,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How about:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300920,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"sky\", \"bulb\", \"high?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305280,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The answer is light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306780,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, not all sets of three words share a connection, of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309680,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, what's amazing is experiments have shown, people can determine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312880,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether they do or not, in only a few seconds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315700,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "long before they figure out what the actual association is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319240,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is due to the sensation of cognitive ease,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322100,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "somewhere deep in the brain, these associations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324560,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cause a flicker of recognition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326500,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which feels pleasant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328140,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the same reason why people say \"to go with your gut\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330760,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on multiple choice tests,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331980,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you're not exactly sure of the answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334460,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, is this true or false:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336480,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"All roses are flowers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338680,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some flowers fade quickly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341580,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "therefore some roses fade quickly.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344760,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Yeah.\" \"You can say that follows.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346760,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"One would think it would be true.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349280,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"But I got a feeling it's not.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351480,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The actual answer is \"False.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353240,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Roses aren't necessarily the \"some flowers\" that fade quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357140,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A test using a similar set of three questions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359160,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "found that 90% of people made at least one mistake"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361920,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the questions printed clearly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364080,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when a test was printed like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366920,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the error rate dropped to 35%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369240,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Making the test harder to read actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371440,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "INCREASED the accuracy of reseults."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373900,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is because the illegible text creates cognitive strain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376860,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forcing your brain to work harder,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378600,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that helps avoid the pitfall and jumping to the intuitive, but wrong answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383100,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cognitive ease is useful for being creative and intuitive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386060,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it also makes you more gullible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387780,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for the written part of your driving test,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390000,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going with your gut is probably a good strategy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392300,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in areas like Physics where the answers are counter-intuitive and there are many common misconceptions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397420,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's important to be more skeptical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399540,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This vigilance takes effort."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401640,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's also associated with being... unhappy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404460,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you ever noticed that some of the best scientists and analytical minds are grumpy and suspicious of everything?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410540,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean I think this could be more than just poor social skills"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413320,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it may be essential for them to do their job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415560,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is a paradox of learning and critical thinking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418900,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cognitive ease is pleasant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420960,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is effortless, familiar, and it really does make you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423760,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more creative and intuitive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425480,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it can also trick you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427260,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It may make things SEEM true that aren't,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429640,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you may feel like you're learning when you're not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432440,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the other hand, being skeptical and analytical takes more mental work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436680,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's more confusing and it doesn't feel it's good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439360,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but... it's the best way to separate fact from fiction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442440,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you might think that the point of this video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444060,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to say that we only to think critically more often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446940,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's not it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448140,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As an analytical thinker myself, I find it takes me like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451020,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "half an hour just to select a toothbrush."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453400,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are definitely times when cognitive ease is the appropriate mental state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457260,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we evolve it for a reason, so we can react intuitively in familiar everyday situations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462220,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why think harder than you have to?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464340,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the key is to identify those times when more thought is required."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468240,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with sharing and repeating ideas,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470000,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "easier than ever before,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471660,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we need to be more vigilant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473580,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to distinguish between those things that are really true"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476580,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those we simply have heard many times before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480580,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The more something is repeated,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482600,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the more it starts to feel true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488560,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This episode was supported by this fine person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490720,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and about thousand others on Patreon. If you want to join them to help me make more videos,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494640,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then click the link."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496200,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Recently I also teamed up with Hot Wheels to make some scientific videos,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499780,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using Hot Wheels' cars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501680,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So (hehe) if you want to check those out, the link is in the description."
    } ]
  } ]
}
